        "content": "\ud83d\udfe1 **Note \u2013 Workflow Setup Recommendation**\n\nCurrently, the workflow is triggered by a **form submission**, where you should provide:\n- **Company Name** in the corresponding input\n- **Company Domain** by pasting the full URL of the company (e.g. `example.com`)\n\n\ud83d\udd01 **Recommended: Loop-Based Automation**\n\nTo automate the process fully, it's recommended to:\n1. **Activate the following deactivated nodes**:\n   - `Execute workflow`\n   - `Google Sheets (read)`\n   - `Loop Over Items`\n\n2. **In your Google Sheet**, create **two columns**:\n   - `Company Name`\n   - `Company Domain` (company URL)\n\n3. **Configure the loop** so that each row from Google Sheets is processed one-by-one.\n\n4. **In the `Set company name and domain` node**, map:\n   - `COMPANY_NAME` \u2192 to the company name from the current item\n   - `COMPANY_DOMAIN` \u2192 to the domain URL from the current item\n\nThis will create a proper looped flow, replacing manual form input with automated processing from the spreadsheet.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
